  <DataPropertyAssertion><DataProperty abbreviatedIRI="kt:description"/><NamedIndividual abbreviatedIRI="kt:sparql-lang-select-union"/><Literal>Language-features ontology: UNION of Woman and Man returns all persons.</Literal></DataPropertyAssertion>
